	(text "Notes:\n1) A 128-character FIFO: two 3341 pairs in cascade. The 3341 is PMOS: Vss = +5V, \n   Vdd = GND, Vgg = −12V.\n2) The 74LS195s are used as parallel-load registers (~PE grounded, J/~K unused).\n3) Bit order is preserved: RXDn → PUNCH_CHn → RELAYn."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
